Condition $\gamma L < \gbari[i+1]$ implies $\Tinm[i+1] < 0$, hence $i \geq \Nbar$ (recall \cref{def:N_bar}: $\Tinm[\bar{N}] \geq 0$ and $\Tinm[\bar{N}+1] < 0$, corresponding to $\gamma L < \gbari[\bar{N}+1]$). Then the coefficient of the mixed term in \eqref{eq:dist_1_mu_1_step_decrease} is positive:%
